THREAT REPORT — HIDDEN SOUND VILLAGE (OTOGAKURE)
Intelligence Division

Otogakure is a young hidden village founded and led by the missing-nin
Orochimaru. It has no formal standing among the Five Great Nations and
functions largely as an instrument of its founder's ambitions.

Assessed Threats:
- Human experimentation: Orochimaru conducts forbidden research into
  body modification, kekkei genkai transfer, and the cursed seal. Test
  subjects are drawn from captured and recruited shinobi.
- The Sound Four (later Five): an elite guard unit with cursed-seal
  transformations, deployed as Orochimaru's enforcers.
- Historical hostility: Otogakure allied with Sunagakure to launch the
  Konoha Crush during the Chunin Exams (see Konoha Crush report).
- Continued interest in Sasuke Uchiha and the Sharingan.

Recommendation: Treat all Sound operatives as hostile. Cursed-seal
users may exhibit sudden power spikes; do not underestimate. Maintain
watch on the eastern approaches.
